{title: Harbor Light}
{artist: Mara Quinn}
{key: G}
# arranged for the Sela test corpus
{comment: Gently}
[G]Out on the [C]water the [G]evening is long
The [D]harbor light [G]carries a song

{start_of_chorus}
[C]Shine on, [G]shine on
[D]Guide every boat back [G]home
{end_of_chorus}

{c: Second time softer}
[G]Morning will [C]find us with [G]nets on the shore
[D]Grateful for [G]all we were given and more
{chorus}
